      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A: final product for users\nB: tools developer use to build the final product\nC: dependencies of tools\n\nHow to learn:\n- as a user, focus on input and output\n- as a developer\n    - learn APIs of tools\n    - build the final product\n    - ignore the details of tools' dependencies",
